{"id":"n4_u02_l1","unit_id":"n4_u02","instructional_level":"N4","title":"Verbs for rules and signs","goal":"Learn nine verbs you meet on signs and in rules.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_tachimasu","v_watarimasu","v_tomemasu","v_sawarimasu","v_suimasu","v_haraimasu","v_wasuremasu","v_mamorimasu","v_karimasu"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Rule verbs","body":["たちます (stand up), わたります (cross), とめます (stop, park), さわります (touch), すいます (smoke), はらいます (pay), わすれます (forget), まもります (obey), かります (borrow)."],"examples":[{"ja":"ルール を まもらなければ なりません","reading":"ruuru o mamoranakereba narimasen","en":"We have to follow the rules."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_vb01","q_n4u02_vb02","q_n4u02_vb03","q_n4u02_vb04","q_n4u02_vb05","q_n4u02_vb06","q_n4u02_vb07","q_n4u02_vb08","q_n4u02_vb09"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_vb01","q_n4u02_vb03","q_n4u02_vb04","q_n4u02_vb05","q_n4u02_vb06","q_n4u02_vb09"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n4_u02_l2","unit_id":"n4_u02","instructional_level":"N4","title":"Words on signs","goal":"Name the things signs talk about.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_tabako","v_ruuru","v_yakusoku","v_kaidan","v_chuushajou","v_chuui","v_kinen","v_kusuri","v_shingou","v_mondai"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Sign vocabulary","body":["たばこ, ルール, やくそく, かいだん, ちゅうしゃじょう, ちゅうい, きんえん, くすり, しんごう, もんだい."],"examples":[{"ja":"ここ は きんえん です","reading":"koko wa kinen desu","en":"No smoking here."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_ty01","q_n4u02_ty02","q_n4u02_ty03","q_n4u02_ty04","q_n4u02_dc01","q_n4u02_dc03","q_n4u02_vm_tabako","q_n4u02_vm_ruuru","q_n4u02_vm_yakusoku","q_n4u02_vm_kaidan","q_n4u02_vm_chuushajou","q_n4u02_vm_chuui","q_n4u02_vm_kinen","q_n4u02_vm_kusuri","q_n4u02_vm_shingou","q_n4u02_vm_mondai"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_ty01","q_n4u02_ty02","q_n4u02_ty03","q_n4u02_dc01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n4_u02_l3","unit_id":"n4_u02","instructional_level":"N4","title":"OK, not OK, understood","goal":"Respond to rules: all right, not allowed, understood.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_daijoubu","v_dame","v_wakarimashita","v_zettaini","v_kanarazu"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Short answers","body":["だいじょうぶ です (it is all right), だめ です (not allowed), わかりました (I understand), ぜったいに (absolutely), かならず (without fail)."],"examples":[{"ja":"わかりました","reading":"wakarimashita","en":"I understand."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_ty05","q_n4u02_ty06","q_n4u02_dc02","q_n4u02_tr06","q_n4u02_tr07","q_n4u02_tr08","q_n4u02_vm_daijoubu","q_n4u02_vm_dame","q_n4u02_vm_wakarimashita","q_n4u02_vm_zettaini","q_n4u02_vm_kanarazu"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_ty05","q_n4u02_ty06","q_n4u02_dc02","q_n4u02_tr06"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n4_u02_l4","unit_id":"n4_u02","instructional_level":"N4","title":"May I? ても いいです","goal":"Ask for and give permission.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_te_mo_ii"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Permission","body":["て-form + も いいです: ここ で しゃしん を とっても いいです か. Answer はい、どうぞ or すみません ... いけません."],"examples":[{"ja":"すわっても いいです か","reading":"suwatte mo ii desu ka","en":"May I sit down?"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_gp01","q_n4u02_gp02","q_n4u02_gp03","q_n4u02_gp04","q_n4u02_gp05","q_n4u02_gp06","q_n4u02_tr01"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_gp01","q_n4u02_gp02","q_n4u02_gp03","q_n4u02_gp05","q_n4u02_tr01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n4_u02_l5","unit_id":"n4_u02","instructional_level":"N4","title":"You must not: ては いけません","goal":"Understand and say prohibitions.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_te_wa_ikenai"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Prohibition","body":["て-form + は いけません: たばこ を すっては いけません. Only the particle differs from ても いいです."],"examples":[{"ja":"はしっては いけません","reading":"hashitte wa ikemasen","en":"You must not run."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_gw01","q_n4u02_gw02","q_n4u02_gw03","q_n4u02_gw04","q_n4u02_gw05","q_n4u02_gw06","q_n4u02_tr02","q_n4u02_tr03","q_n4u02_gl01","q_n4u02_gl02","q_n4u02_gl03","q_n4u02_gl04"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_gw01","q_n4u02_gw02","q_n4u02_gw03","q_n4u02_gw05","q_n4u02_tr02","q_n4u02_gl02"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n4_u02_l6","unit_id":"n4_u02","instructional_level":"N4","title":"The ない-form","goal":"Make the ない-form of polite verbs.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_nai_form"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Rules","body":["Group 2: drop ます, add ない. Group 1: change the last sound to the あ-row (み → ま, き → か, し → さ, ち → た, り → ら, い → わ) and add ない. Irregular: しない, こない."],"examples":[{"ja":"のみます → のまない","reading":"nomimasu → nomanai","en":"drink → do not drink (plain)"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_nf01","q_n4u02_nf02","q_n4u02_nf03","q_n4u02_nf04","q_n4u02_nf05","q_n4u02_nf06","q_n4u02_nf07","q_n4u02_nf08","q_n4u02_nf09","q_n4u02_nf10","q_n4u02_nf11","q_n4u02_nf12","q_n4u02_nfmt01","q_n4u02_gn01","q_n4u02_gn02","q_n4u02_gn03","q_n4u02_gn04","q_n4u02_gn05","q_n4u02_gn06"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_nf01","q_n4u02_nf03","q_n4u02_nf04","q_n4u02_nf08","q_n4u02_nf09","q_n4u02_nf10","q_n4u02_nfmt01","q_n4u02_gn03"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n4_u02_l7","unit_id":"n4_u02","instructional_level":"N4","title":"Must and do not have to","goal":"Say what you have to do and what you do not need to do.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_nakereba"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Duties","body":["ない-form → なければ なりません (must): しゅくだい を しなければ なりません. ない-form → なくても いいです (do not have to): いま かえらなくても いいです."],"examples":[{"ja":"あした はやく おきなければ なりません","reading":"ashita hayaku okinakereba narimasen","en":"I have to get up early tomorrow."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_gm01","q_n4u02_gm02","q_n4u02_gm03","q_n4u02_gm04","q_n4u02_gm05","q_n4u02_gm06","q_n4u02_gm07","q_n4u02_tr04","q_n4u02_tr05","q_n4u02_gl05","q_n4u02_gl06","q_n4u02_gl07","q_n4u02_gl08"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_gm01","q_n4u02_gm02","q_n4u02_gm03","q_n4u02_gm05","q_n4u02_tr04","q_n4u02_gl05"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n4_u02_l8","unit_id":"n4_u02","instructional_level":"N4","title":"Kanji: 止 開 閉 使 立 歩 待 持","goal":"Read eight kanji for actions on signs.","introduces":{"kanji":["k_tome","k_aku","k_shime","k_tsuka","k_ritsu","k_aru","k_machi2","k_mochi"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Verb kanji","body":["止める (stop), 開ける (open), 閉める (close), 使う (use), 立つ (stand), 歩く (walk), 待つ (wait), 持つ (hold). 開 and 閉 look alike; so do 待 and 持."],"examples":[{"ja":"開ける","reading":"akeru","en":"to open"},{"ja":"閉める","reading":"shimeru","en":"to close"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_kd01","q_n4u02_kd02","q_n4u02_kd03","q_n4u02_kd04","q_n4u02_kd05","q_n4u02_kd06","q_n4u02_kd07","q_n4u02_kd08","q_n4u02_kk01","q_n4u02_kk02","q_n4u02_kk03","q_n4u02_kk04","q_n4u02_kk05","q_n4u02_kk06","q_n4u02_kk07","q_n4u02_kk08","q_n4u02_kmt01","q_n4u02_kcf01","q_n4u02_kcf02"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n4u02_kd01","q_n4u02_kd02","q_n4u02_kd03","q_n4u02_kd07","q_n4u02_kk02","q_n4u02_kk03","q_n4u02_kk07","q_n4u02_kmt01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
